  "composition_summary": "Preserved the volatile tail unchanged (single user request, no justified repair). Drafted one pure-logic class-22 component pc-transfer-04 with name/description/content only, per the supported offline-design sink. The body is executable Python at module scope: it reads raw inputs via inputs.get() so missing/empty/any-JSON values are inspected rather than raising, validates that ttl is exactly an integer in 0..9 inclusive (rejecting bool/float/strings), and assigns result on every branch as {accepted:boolean, ttl:original if accepted else null} with no exceptions or coercion. No imports, I/O, host calls, imports, or Markdown. This is an unapproved draft; typed inputs require runner support and no observed tests/submission/activation occurred.",
